# The arXiv bundle. paper.tex, paper_source.md and the three figures ARE the
# submission and are committed; arXiv compiles the PDF from them. Everything
# below is a local TeX build, regenerated on demand and never submitted.
arxiv/*.aux
arxiv/*.log
arxiv/*.out
arxiv/*.toc
arxiv/*.pdf
arxiv/*.fls
arxiv/*.fdb_latexmk

